The built-in remote desktop engine includes third-party software:

- IronRDP (https://github.com/Devolutions/IronRDP), MIT or Apache-2.0,
  and its Rust dependencies, compiled into src/backend/engine/wasm.
- xterm.js headless (https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js), MIT.
- opentype.js (https://github.com/opentypejs/opentype.js), MIT.
- DejaVu Sans Mono fonts, see src/backend/engine/worker/telnet/fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt.
- guacamole-common-js and guacamole-lite, Apache-2.0 and MIT.
